====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

<ref name="OED2"/>
#{{US|and|Canadian|_|slang}} A [[bundle]] carried by a [[hobo]] (usually containing his possessions); a [[blanket roll]].<ref name="OED2"/>
#{{US|and|Canadian|_|slang}} Any bundle or [[package]]; specifically one containing [[narcotic]]s such as [[cocaine]], [[heroin]], or [[morphine]].<ref name="OED2"/>

